@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@sourceAccountId = REPLACE_WITH_FUNDED_SOURCE_ID
@destinationAccountId = REPLACE_WITH_DESTINATION_ID
@transactionId = REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_ID

### Transfer (requires an already funded development account; no public top-up API)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: transfer-demo-001
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{sourceAccountId}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{destinationAccountId}}",
  "amount": "200000",
  "currency": "VND",
  "description": "Chuyển tiền nội bộ demo"
}

### Detail including both ledger entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### History for source (also works for destination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{sourceAccountId}}/transactions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### History for a local Vietnamese day, expressed in UTC: [00:00 VN, next 00:00 VN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{sourceAccountId}}/transactions?from=2026-10-26T17:00:00Z&to=2026-10-27T17:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Self-transfer must fail with 400 SAME_ACCOUNT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-self-transfer-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{sourceAccountId}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{sourceAccountId}}",
  "amount": "1",
  "currency": "VND"
}
